cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use OpenHarness, please cite it as below."
title: "OpenHarness: an observable, testable, priced plugin layer for agent behavioral rules"
abstract: >-
  OpenHarness removes behavioral rules from an agent's skills and re-mounts them
  as a plugin layer above the agent. Each rule becomes a harness module with a
  declared scope, a conformance check, and a price; binding is decided by the
  layer, not the agent. The result is an observable stream of verdicts and a
  per-module harness card — competence by task type, conformance, cost, and
  momentum — that together form a transparency dashboard.
